---
import DocsLayout from "@layouts/DocsLayout.astro";
---

<DocsLayout
    title="Building from Source"
    description="Build Axon from source code"
>
    <h1>Building from Source</h1>

    <p>
        Axon is open source. You can build the editor from source to test the
        latest changes, contribute patches, or create custom builds.
    </p>

    <h2>Prerequisites</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Node.js</strong> — v18 or later</li>
        <li><strong>Go</strong> — v1.21 or later</li>
        <li><strong>Git</strong> — for cloning the repository</li>
        <li><strong>make</strong> — optional, for build scripts</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Cloning the Repository</h2>
    <pre><code>git clone https://github.com/GordenArcher/axon
cd axon</code></pre>

    <h2>Running in Development Mode</h2>
    <p>
        You need two terminal sessions: one for the Go backend and one for the
        Electron frontend.
    </p>

    <h3>Terminal 1: Start Go Backend</h3>
    <pre><code>cd core
go run cmd/axon/main.go</code></pre>
    <p>
        The backend runs on <code>localhost:7777</code>.
    </p>

    <h3>Terminal 2: Start Electron App</h3>
    <pre><code>cd editor
npm install
npm run build:main
npm run dev</code></pre>

    <h2>Building for Production</h2>
    <pre><code>cd editor
npm run build
npm run pack</code></pre>

    <p>Platform-specific packages:</p>
    <pre><code>npm run dist:mac     # macOS (both architectures)
npm run dist:win     # Windows
npm run dist:linux   # Linux</code></pre>

    <p>Build output goes to <code>editor/release/</code>.</p>

    <h2>Language Servers</h2>
    <p>To bundle language servers locally:</p>
    <pre><code>npm run build:language-servers</code></pre>

    <h2>Project Structure</h2>
    <pre><code>axon/
├── core/              # Go backend
│   ├── cmd/axon/      # Entry point
│   └── internal/      # Internal packages
│       ├── fs/        # File system operations
│       ├── server/    # HTTP server
│       └── terminal/  # PTY + WebSocket
├── editor/            # Electron + React frontend
│   ├── src/
│   │   ├── main/      # Electron main process
│   │   ├── preload/   # Context bridge
│   │   └── renderer/  # React UI
└── docs/              # Documentation</code></pre>
</DocsLayout>
